    "title": "Foxglove bridge missing from repositories",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros2/ros2/issues/1809",
    "body": "### Generated by Generative AI\n\n_No response_\n\n### Operating System:\n\nros:humble Docker image\n\n### ROS version or commit hash:\n\nhumble\n\n### RMW implementation (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### RMW Configuration (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### Client library (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### 'ros2 doctor --report' output\n\n<details><summary>ros2 doctor --report</summary>\n\n```console\n<COPY OUTPUT HERE>\n```\n</details>\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce issue\n\n```docker run --rm -it ros:humble\napt update\napt install ros-$ROS_DISTRO-foxglove-bridge```\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n`apt` successfully installs Foxglove Bridge\n\n### Actual behavior\n\n```Reading package lists... Done\nBuilding dependency tree... Done\nReading state information... Done\nE: Unable to locate package ros-humble-foxglove-bridge```\n\n### Additional information\n\nThis issue has only started for me 2 days ago, before that installation for Foxglove Bridge was working normally.",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Generated by Generative AI</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Operating System:</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">ros:humble Docker image</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">ROS version or commit hash:</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">humble</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">RMW implementation (if applicable):</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">RMW Configuration (if applicable):</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Client library (if applicable):</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">'ros2 doctor --report' output</h3>\n<details><summary>ros2 doctor --report</summary>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-shell-session notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;COPY OUTPUT HERE&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;COPY OUTPUT HERE&gt;</span></pre></div>\n</details>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Steps to reproduce issue</h3>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"apt update\napt install ros-$ROS_DISTRO-foxglove-bridge```\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n`apt` successfully installs Foxglove Bridge\n\n### Actual behavior\n\n```Reading package lists... Done\nBuilding dependency tree... Done\nReading state information... Done\nE: Unable to locate package ros-humble-foxglove-bridge```\n\n### Additional information\n\nThis issue has only started for me 2 days ago, before that installation for Foxglove Bridge was working normally.\"><pre lang=\"docker\" class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">apt update\napt install ros-$ROS_DISTRO-foxglove-bridge```\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n`apt` successfully installs Foxglove Bridge\n\n### Actual behavior\n\n```Reading package lists... Done\nBuilding dependency tree... Done\nReading state information... Done\nE: Unable to locate package ros-humble-foxglove-bridge```\n\n### Additional information\n\nThis issue has only started for me 2 days ago, before that installation for Foxglove Bridge was working normally.\n</code></pre></div>",
