      "body": "It looks like in the most recent Humble sync `foxglove_bridge` was removed: https://discourse.openrobotics.org/t/new-packages-for-humble-hawksbill-2026-03-20/53413\n\nI'm not sure why, but you can ask on that thread maybe?\n\n@christophebedard FYI",
